<section class="section" aria-labelledby="honest-title">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h2 id="honest-title" class="first-h2">What we can and cannot say about your area</h2>
    <p>AccountOrbit takes enquiries by phone from across Delhi and works without branches or local offices. We do not publish who is available or where. An area named on this site is there because it helps explain local business, not because anyone is based there.</p>
    <p>You will not find a page for every neighbourhood here. A page that only swaps an area's name would not help you, so we have separate pages only where an area's trade changes what your books need. They explain that trade, and do not mean a professional is available there.</p>
    <p>Wherever you are, ask a professional where they work from and whether they can visit. See {% routeLink "/guides/how-to-hire-an-accountant-in-delhi/", "how to hire an accountant in Delhi" %}.</p>
  </div>
</section>
